  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Legislative and institutional reforms enables an autonomous national statistical system, The quality and range of statistics produced by the National Statistics System satisfy the increasing needs of statistics users and development planners, System of data collection partners formalized</narrative>
  </description>
